MIOK YOU DESTROYED THE ENEMY RELAY STATION
FAIL YOU DESTROYED THE ENEMY RELAY STATION\n BUT YOU MUST PRESERVE ALL YOUR MEN ALIVEMIIN YOU CAN NOT ESCAPE YET.\nYOU HAVE NOT DESTROYED THE ENEMY HEADQUARTERS.
ESMU YOU DESTROYED THE DAM\nAND YOU GOT TO THE ESCAPE POINT,\n BUT SOME OF YOUR MEN ARE DEAD.
DEPO YOU DIDN'T DESTROY ALL THE OBJECTIVES.\nYOU WON'T BE ABLE TO GO ON WITH\nTHE NEXT MISSION UNTIL YOU DESTROY THEM.
MIOK YOU HAVE SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED THE MISSION.
NOOK THE MISSION HAS FAILED\n ALL YOUR MEN ARE DEAD OR CAPTURED\nYOU ARE NOT ALLOWED TO CONTINUE.
ALIA YOU MANAGED TO ESCAPE,\n BUT YOU MUST PRESERVE ALL YOUR MEN.
NOPI YOU NEED THE PILOT TO ESCAPE.IOK2 YOU HAVE SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED THE MISSION.
IND2 YOU MANAGED TO ESCAPE,\nBUT YOU DIDN'T DESTROY THE RADAR.\nYOU WON'T BE ABLE TO GO ON WITH \nTHE NEXT MISSION UNTIL YOU DESTROY IT.
INTE ALL OF YOUR MEN NEED TO ESCAPE\nIN ORDER TO SUCCESSFULLY\n COMPLETE THE MISSION.
AUD1 YOU HAVE DESTROYED THE RADAR,\nBUT YOU NEED THE AUTOGIRO \nIN ORDER TO COMPLETE THE MISSION.
AUD2 THE AUTOGIRO HAS BEEN DESTROYED,\nSO YOU CANNOT FINISH THE MISSION.
BAD1 YOU MUST ESCAPE WITH ALL OF YOUR MEN\nAND ONLY AFTER THE DESTRUCTION OF ALL THE TARGETS.
BAD2 YOU MANAGED TO ESCAPE,\nBUT YOU DIDN'T DESTROY ALL THE TARGETS.\nYOU WON'T BE ABLE TO GO ON WITH \nTHE NEXT MISSION UNTIL YOU DESTROY THEM.
BAD3 THE LORRY HAS BEEN DESTROYED\nAND YOU NEEDED IT IN ORDER TO ESCAPE\nAFTER COMPLETING THE MISSION.
BOOM YOU HAVE FAILED TO ACCOMPLISH THE MISSION.\nTHE ENEMY ENGINEERS HAVE DESTROYED THE BRIDGE.MIOK YOU SUCCESFULLY RESCUED THE PRISONERS.
NOHO YOU MANAGED TO ESCAPE BUT\n YOU MUST FREE ALL THE PRISONERS.
NOAL YOU MANAGED TO ESCAPE BUT\n YOU MUST PRESERVE ALL YOUR MEN ALIVE.
NOPR YOU MUST LIBERATE THE INFORMER.HUGE THE GENERAL HAS BEEN EVACUATED.DATE Feb 20, 1941
PLAC Sola, Stavenger
TITL Baptism of fire
ABST Incursion to destroy a relay station near the Stavenger airfield
GOAL Blow up antenna
0000 - The driver and the green beret should meet at the dock
0001
0002 - It may be useful to steal the inflatable boat
0003
0004 - All three men should get to the northern island
0005
0006 - The driver should capture the machine gun nest
0007
0008 - A good way to blow up the relay station would be to use the explosive barrels
0009
0010 - Remember, they can see your steps on snow!
0011 %k#end of text markerDATE March 14, 1941
PLAC Sysendam, Eidfjord
TITL Reverse engineering
0000 - Your men will have to arrive successfully to the riverside and neutralise
0001   the enemy soldiers that are watching the river area
0002
0003 - The diver will have to steal the inflatable boat without attracting attention,
0004   and help the spy take the enemy uniform
0005
0006 - The spy may infiltrate the southern camp and shut down power to the electric fence
0007
0008 - The sapper will then be able to cut the fence to get into the southern camp
0009   and steal the explosive charges
0010
0011 - One explosive charge may be used to neutralize the surveillance bunker nearby
0012   the dam
0013
0014 - The other charge may be set next to the base of the dam to blow it up
0015
0016 - Once the dam explodes, a friendly truck will take your men back home
0017   from the northwestern area.
0018 %k#end of text markerDATE March 1, 1941
PLAC Stamsund, Lofoten Islands
TITL A Quiet Blow-up
ABST Blow up fuel depots while in Operation Claymore
GOAL Blow up depots and escape with the truck
0000 - All buildings with flags have troops inside, as soon as the
0001   alarm is raised they'll rush out
0002
0003 - The driver may capture the truck and drive all of your men home
0004   following the road east
0005
0006 - If the enemy soldiers capture one of your men, they may take him
0007   to one of the prisons, another of your men may go and rescue him
0008
0009 %k#end of text markerDATE March 10, 1941
PLAC Stokkan, Trondheim
TITL Restore pride
ABST Attack to the Stokkan HQ, near Trondheim
GOAL Destroy mansion and escape using the docked patrol boat
0000 - Neutralize the enemy soldiers which are watching around the river area.
0001
0002 - Be careful, there are motorized guards around who will rush to alarm
0003   the soldiers at the camp.
0004
0005 - Find parachute and take supplies.
0006
0007 - The arch at the entrance can be demolished to block the guards.
0008
0009 - The sapper may set a bomb to blow up the mansion.
0010
0011 - Once the enemy headquarters are destroyed, all of your men should escape
0012   using the docked patrol boat.
0013 %k#end of text markerDATE Nov 14, 1942
PLAC El Agheila
TITL Operation Icarus
0000 - It'll probably be convenient to steal a Panzer tank in order to escape
0001
0002 - Free McRae from the prison where he is kept
0003
0004 - Destroy the weapon store inside the camp and the stukas beside
0005   the big plane
0006
0007 - Once free, McRae can pilot the Junker in order to escape
0008 %k#end of text markerDATE May 2, 1941
PLAC Herdla
TITL Blind justice
ABST Destroy the radar station
GOAL Destroy radar antenna and escape
0000 - The spy should steal the enemy uniform to disguise himself as an enemy officer
0001
0002 - The telephone in southern post may be used to call attention
0003   in the northern post
0004
0005 - Your men can gain access to the top section either by cable car
0006   or climbing the rocky wall to the east
0007
0008 - There are rumours that there are minefields in the bottom section,
0009   watch the paths of enemy patrols to discover secure tracks.
0010
0011 - The green beret can use the shovel to dig a hole and camouflage
0012   himself in the snow.
0013
0014 - It will probably be better to blow up the top garrison
0015
0016 - Use the autogiro near the antenna to escape.
0017
0018 %k#end of text markerDATE May 10, 1941
PLAC Masi
TITL Menace of the Leopold
ABST Destruction of the Leopold long range cannon
GOAL Destroy cannon and escape on a friendly truck which will come pick up the commandos
0000 - You can probably blow up the SDKFZ 231 light tank in the southwestern
0001   area without the patrols at the enemy garrisons hearing the explosion.
0002
0003 - Once the cannon explodes, a friendly truck will take your men back home
0004   from the northeastern area.
0005
0006 - Be careful, because the enemy soldiers can blow up the escape truck
0007   with the machine guns.
0008
0009 %k#end of text markerDATE Oct 19, 1942
PLAC Tell el Eisa
TITL Pyrotechnics
0000 - Your goal is to blow up the barrels, the depots and the large reservoir,
0001   and then escape on a jeep which will come to the extraction point
0002   at the northeastern area.
0003
0004 - Clear up the area for the friendly jeep to arrive, there are several
0005   weapons aiming in that direction
0006
0007 - The cannon which aims towards the eastern area can be destroyed
0008   using an explosive barrel.
0009
0010 - Remember you can get into houses to hide from enemies
0011
0012 %k#end of text markerDATE Oct 20, 1942
PLAC Bab el Qattara
TITL A Courtesy Call
0000 - Your goal is to destroy the antenna and the communications control building,
0001   the weapons store, the command post and the bunker
0002
0003 - The biggest problem will be the panzers which may get out and shoot
0004   at your men if you are not careful
0005
0006 - Once all the goals are accomplished, all your men should escape on the
0007   truck which will come get you along the road towards the southwest
0008
0009 %k#end of text markerDATE March 15, 1943
PLAC Tunis
TITL Up on the Roof
0000 - Your goal is to free the prisoner and escape
0001
0002 - Silent actions on the roofs will probably not be noticed by
0003   enemy soldiers on the lower levels
0004
0005 - Once your men have accomplished the mission, escape on the
0006   Kübelwagen car on the southern area
0007 %k#end of text markerDATE Dec 3, 1942
PLAC Maradah
TITL In The Soup
ABST Destroy four drilling rigs at Maradah
GOAL Destroy the four drilling towers and escape to friendly vehicle
0000 - It will probably be helpful to blow up the tunnel in order to
0001   block the movement of enemy patrols
0002
0003 - Once all the towers are blown up, get to the escape SDKFZ
0004   and rush away towards the northwestern area
0005
0006 %k#end of text markerDATE Feb 7, 1942
PLAC Arendal, Norway
TITL Chase of the Wolves
ABST Destroy a U-Boat shelter
GOAL Destroy U-Boats and escape using a row boat to the buoy
0000 - Find and take the explosives
0001
0002 - Set the explosive charges at the torpedos on top of the U-Boats to
0003   make the explosion powerful enough to blow them up completely
0004
0005 - Your men will have to take and use the SDKFZ
0006
0007 - Take the row boat and escape towards the buoy in the southeastern area
0008
0009 %k#end of text markerDATE May 15, 1944
PLAC Port of Le Havre
TITL David and Goliath
ABST Sabotage a replica of the Bismarck
GOAL Sabotage battleship, destroy fuel depots and escape to the buoy
0000 - Your men should blow up the fuel depots by the battleship
0001
0002 - The diver may capture the minisubmarine, and use it to fire a torpedo
0003   against battleship to blow it up
0004
0005 - The driver may block the exit of the tank with the truck
0006
0007 - Once the battleship and the depots are destroyed, your men should
0008   use the light boat to arrive to the buoy at the south
0009
0010 - Watch out for the enemy patrol boats, your men may use the cannon
0011   at the southern dock to blow them up
0012
0013 %k#end of text markerDATE Sep 4, 1944
PLAC Bridge over the Maas river, north of Liege
TITL Stop Wildfire
ABST Avoid the blow-up of a bridge north of Liege
GOAL Neutralize the enemy engineers who can blow up the bridge and escape
0000 - There are four enemy sappers which may activate one charge each
0001
0002 - All of them are watching each other
0003
0004 - If they see anything suspicious, they will detonate their charges
0005   and thus blow up the bridge
0006
0007 - Your men should neutralize the enemy sappers almost simultaneously
0008
0009 - Once the sappers have been liquidated, escape using the truck
0010   in the southeastern area
0011 %k#end of text markerDATE Dec 16, 1944
PLAC Bridge over the Maas river, north of Liege
TITL The Force of Circumstance
ABST Blow up the same bridge defended in Mission 16
GOAL Blow up the bridge and escape to friendly vehicle
0000 - Find the explosive charges and place them on the weakest spots of
0001   the bridge
0002
0003 - Your men may find the panzer quite useful to accomplish the
0004   task at hand
0005
0006 - The trains arriving at the station can be used to hide behind
0007
0008 - Take your men to the friendly vehicle around the southeastearn
0009   area, and get away along the road
0010 %k#end of text markerDATE Nov 28, 1944
PLAC Riveauvillé, north of Colmar
TITL Before Dawn
ABST Free French Resistance prisioners at Riveauvillé
GOAL Free the prisoners and escape with them on the ally truck in the northwestern area
0000 - There is a mobile bridge which may be operated with a lever, you'll
0001   probably find it useful
0002
0003 - Sometimes, letting one of your men be arrested can
0004   deceive the enemy
0005
0006 - You may find it helpful to open the oil depots in the camp and
0007   set fire to them
0008
0009 - All of your men and the prisoners should get to the friendly truck
0010   in the northwestern area in order to escape
0011 %k#end of text markerDATE Aug 26, 1944
PLAC Compiègne
TITL The End of the Butcher
0000 - The best moment to neutralize the enemy general would be during
0001   his morning walk.
0002
0003 - If your men raise the alarm the General will be evacuated, so be silent!
0004
0005 - Your men must also blow up the headquarters. They can use the oil
0006   truck or the cars to make it explode.
0007
0008 - Once the mission is accomplished, steal the truck at the cemetery
0009   and escape towards the northwestern area.
0010 %k#end of text markerDATE Jan 12, 1945
PLAC Oldenburg, west of Bremen
TITL Frustrate Retaliation
ABST Destroy V2 launching pad
GOAL Destroy V2 rockets and escape
0000 - Your men may use the light rail truck and the conveyor to overcome
0001   enemy surveillance and get inside the camp
0002
0003 - After crossing the bridge, you may find it useful to blow it up by
0004 setting an explosive charge to block it
0005
0006 - Once the V2 rockets are destroyed, you may get away to the extraction
0007 point in the northeastern area
0008
0009 - The river has a strong stream, so take it into account
0010
0011 - Be careful with the dogs!
0012
0013 - Escape on the boat towards the northeast
0014
0015 %k#end of text markerDATE May 25, 1944
PLAC La Rivière
TITL D-Day Kick Off
0000 - Your goal is to destroy the four naval coastal batteries and escape
0001
0002 - The ability of the marine to dive and arrive to different areas unseen
0003   will be very helpful
0004
0005 - The green beret can climb to access the hill in the center of the island
0006   and surpass the walls.
0007
0008 - The marine can use the harpoon in the outer areas, it won't
0009   be noticed
0010
0011 - Your men can use the Panzer II tank to get back to the boat
0012
0013 - Once on the boat, escape to the extraction point marked by a buoy
0014   on the southeastern area
0015 %k#end of text markerDATE Feb 11, 1945
PLAC Guyndelfingen, north of Freiburg
TITL Operation Valhalla
ABST Destroy a fortress
GOAL Destroy the enemy headquarters and escape
0000 - Your goal is to destroy the general headquarters
0001   in the northwestern part of the fortress and the V2 rockets.
0002
0003 - There is an alternative way into the main gates: the underwater
0004   access on the eastern section
0005
0006 - It seems your green beret will be able to climb the western wall of
0007   the castle
0008
0009 - There is a cannon protecting the tank, your men should blow it up
0010
0011 - If your men shoot in the shoot practicing area, men inside garrisons
0012   will not be alarmed by the gun shots
0013
0014 - Escape on the panzer along the road towards the southwest
0015
0016 %k#end of text marker{
